<title>BELGIUM: KB Securities rates UCB &quot;accumulate&quot;.</title>
<headline>KB Securities rates UCB &quot;accumulate&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>UCB	     Chemicals/drugs 115,750*   KB Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Earnings forecasts for 1997, 1998 are upgraded, taking its P/E ratios to upper end of range of leading European pharmaceutical stocks. However, our long-term growth rate for current earnings of 25.7 percent between 1995/96 to 1999/2000 exceeds consensus growth forecasts of comparable pharma issues.</p>
<p>We therefore maintain accumulate recommendation. Our twelve month target range is 133,100 francs. Recommendation: ACCUMULATE</p>
<p>Analyst: Juergen Fryges (*) Date of research report: 20/06/97</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Net dividend</p>
<p> 1997	   4,159 BFR  3,481 BFR 27.9	950 BFR</p>
<p> 1998	   5,037 BFR  4,093 BFR 23.0    1,100 BFR</p>
<p> 1999	   6,010 BFR  n/a	 19.3    1,340 BFR</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
